WEBVTT

00:00:00.469 --> 00:00:05.165
Welcome to Alaventra. Rank in
search. Get recommended by AI.

00:00:06.143 --> 00:00:11.518
In tutorial 5.2, you'll plan a climb from
easy pages up to the keyword you really

00:00:11.568 --> 00:00:12.204
want.

00:00:13.245 --> 00:00:16.765
First, on your Pipeline,
click New keyword ladder.

00:00:16.815 --> 00:00:21.055
Recommended for you lists keywords from
your own research, the best ones first.

00:00:22.199 --> 00:00:27.099
Choose for me picks the easiest one for
you, and Find new keywords looks for more.

00:00:27.149 --> 00:00:30.504
A warning shows when one of your
ladders already covers a search.

00:00:31.551 --> 00:00:35.616
Have your own keyword in mind?
Type it here, choose the country,

00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:39.091
and Check it rates it the
same way, for about 3 credits.

00:00:39.141 --> 00:00:41.154
Here, we pick a recommended one.

00:00:42.117 --> 00:00:46.167
Back in Recommended for you, read
the difficulty for your site.

00:00:46.217 --> 00:00:51.019
It's rated from what your website already
ranks for, from easy to not realistic.

00:00:52.003 --> 00:00:55.253
This one is reachable for your
site, with a short ladder.

00:00:55.303 --> 00:00:56.831
Click Choose this keyword.

00:00:59.053 --> 00:01:03.103
Now review the plan. It's Direct
when a keyword is easy for you,

00:01:03.153 --> 00:01:05.328
and a full ladder when it's hard.

00:01:05.378 --> 00:01:08.993
This short ladder writes a few
easy supporting pages first,

00:01:09.043 --> 00:01:11.644
then the main page once
half of them are live.

00:01:12.648 --> 00:01:17.098
Checks shows what was looked at before it
starts: that the topic fits your business,

00:01:17.148 --> 00:01:18.649
and that you have the credits.

00:01:21.148 --> 00:01:25.348
Then choose how it runs. Auto
writes its pages in your weekly run.

00:01:25.398 --> 00:01:29.389
Manual waits for your OK on
each one. Here, we keep Auto.

00:01:30.623 --> 00:01:34.823
Pick its priority, after your
current ladders, or Write it first.

00:01:34.873 --> 00:01:37.247
Then choose how many pages to write now.

00:01:39.691 --> 00:01:44.851
Finally, click Continue. Ready to start
sums it all up, with the price in credits.

00:01:44.901 --> 00:01:46.833
Start the ladder begins the plan.

00:01:48.666 --> 00:01:52.741
A few minutes after you start, your
ladder gets its own page on the Pipeline,

00:01:52.791 --> 00:01:56.341
like this one, with its
plan and its next step.

00:01:56.391 --> 00:02:00.239
Each page then arrives as its
own report, ready to publish.

00:02:01.259 --> 00:02:05.949
So: choose a keyword, read the difficulty,
review the plan, choose how it runs,

00:02:05.999 --> 00:02:07.127
and start the ladder.

00:02:08.713 --> 00:02:14.692
Your climb is planned. Next, follow a
keyword ladder as it climbs, in tutorial 5.3.
